{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "file:server.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "server.js",
      "filePath": "server.js",
      "summary": "HomeLedger 服务端唯一入口：初始化 SQLite、自动创建首个管理员，配置 Express 会话/CSRF/静态资源，挂载全部业务路由，并实现零依赖的 EJS 布局机制与优雅停机。",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "express", "bootstrap", "middleware", "configuration"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "通过重写 res.render 实现零依赖的布局套壳机制（视图先渲染成 body 再套进 layout.ejs）；静态资源缓存戳结合应用版本与文件 mtime，解决「版本未变但文件已改」的浏览器缓存问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:server.js:bootstrapAdmin",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "bootstrapAdmin",
      "filePath": "server.js",
      "lineRange": [36, 53],
      "summary": "首次启动且用户表为空时，依据 ADMIN_USER/ADMIN_PASSWORD 环境变量（默认 admin/admin888）自动创建管理员账号与默认账本，并在控制台提示初始凭据。",
      "tags": ["bootstrap", "initialization", "admin", "security"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/lib/about.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "about.js",
      "filePath": "src/lib/about.js",
      "summary": "「关于」页的静态数据源：产品介绍、功能亮点、版本更新日志与技术栈常量，并提供 repoUrl/issuesUrl 函数解析 GitHub 仓库反馈入口（支持环境变量覆盖与非法地址校验）。",
      "tags": ["utility", "type-definition", "configuration", "static-data"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "数据与行为合一的模块：常量数组驱动页面渲染，发布新版本时只需在 CHANGELOG 数组头部追加一条。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/lib/about.js:repoUrl",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "repoUrl",
      "filePath": "src/lib/about.js",
      "lineRange": [66, 69],
      "summary": "解析仓库地址：环境变量 HOMELEDGER_GITHUB_REPO 优先，回退到内置 GITHUB_REPO 常量，并去除尾部多余斜杠。",
      "tags": ["utility", "configuration", "url"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/lib/about.js:issuesUrl",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "issuesUrl",
      "filePath": "src/lib/about.js",
      "lineRange": [72, 76],
      "summary": "基于 repoUrl 生成 GitHub Issues 反馈地址，用正则校验仓库 URL 合法性，未配置或非法时返回 null 由页面降级展示。",
      "tags": ["utility", "validation", "url"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/lib/charts.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "charts.js",
      "filePath": "src/lib/charts.js",
      "summary": "服务端 SVG 图表渲染工具库：无需前端图表库，纯字符串拼接生成柱状图、折线图、环形图、排行条、日历热力图与进度条，供报表与仪表盘视图直接内嵌。",
      "tags": ["utility", "visualization", "svg", "reporting", "chart"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "零前端框架的 SSR 图表方案：所有坐标由 niceMax 归一化刻度后手工计算，输出带 aria/tooltip 属性的内联 SVG 片段。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/lib/charts.js:niceMax",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "niceMax",
      "filePath": "src/lib/charts.js",
      "lineRange": [23, 30],
      "summary": "将坐标轴最大值向上取整到 1/2/5 倍的 10 的幂，使图表刻度数值更整洁易读。",
      "tags": ["utility", "chart", "math"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/lib/charts.js:barChart",
      "type": "function",
