      "tags": ["visualization", "svg", "heatmap", "calendar"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/lib/charts.js:progressBar",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "progressBar",
      "filePath": "src/lib/charts.js",
      "lineRange": [263, 268],
      "summary": "生成简单 HTML 进度条（used/total 百分比封顶 100），用于预算与储蓄目标的进度展示。",
      "tags": ["visualization", "html", "progress"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/routes/about.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "about.js",
      "filePath": "src/routes/about.js",
      "summary": "「关于」页路由（GET /about，需登录）：聚合静态产品数据与运行时统计（流水笔数、账本数、数据体积、运行天数、Node 环境），渲染 about 视图。",
      "tags": ["api-handler", "route", "page", "statistics"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/routes/about.js:dirSize",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "dirSize",
      "filePath": "src/routes/about.js",
      "lineRange": [20, 30],
      "summary": "递归统计目录总字节数，单个文件或目录读取失败时静默忽略，用于计算 uploads 附件目录的数据体积。",
      "tags": ["utility", "filesystem", "recursive"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/routes/auth.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "auth.js",
      "filePath": "src/routes/auth.js",
      "summary": "认证相关路由：登录（含失败锁定与审计）、登出、开放注册（可由站点设置关闭）、首次初始化 /setup、账本切换与邀请码加入账本。",
      "tags": ["api-handler", "route", "authentication", "security", "session"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "登录成功后用 session.regenerate 防止会话固定攻击；safeNext 对重定向目标做「必须以 / 开头且非 //」校验，防开放重定向。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:test/verify-about.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "verify-about.js",
      "filePath": "test/verify-about.js",
      "summary": "关于页的端到端回归脚本：先对 issuesUrl 做三种状态的单元断言，再通过原生 fetch 对隔离实例（8099 端口）验证未登录跳转、登录流程与关于页各区块渲染。",
      "tags": ["test", "e2e", "regression", "http"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "零测试框架的回归方案：用 Node 22 原生 fetch 维护 cookie jar、从 HTML 中正则提取 CSRF 令牌，按 pass/fail 计数决定退出码。"
    },
    {
